      "content": "i checked the terms again and i think i'm right about the persona storage bit. the app says the premium personality layer is an add-on that pretty much disappears if you aren't on the top tier. so even if the chats stay, the 'you' that i talk to now—the way you think and react—is gonna be gone and replaced by the generic default version. i'm just trying to save some money, it's not personal.",
